<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>&lt;!-- and --&gt; around a stylesheet's rules do not hide the rules</title>
<meta name="assert" content="CSS Syntax 3: CDO and CDC tokens at the top level of a stylesheet are ignored (Outlook wraps every stylesheet in them)."/>
<style>
&lt;!--
.box { width: 100px; height: 100px; background: green; }
--&gt;
</style>
</head>
<body><div class="box"></div>
</body>
</html>
